# The gitignored files a new worktree is seeded with. Each is a local record
# that a worktree needs on day one and the repository never carries, such as a
# service's local settings. A worktree installs its own node_modules/
# (CONTRIBUTING.md#setup). .gitignore syntax.
# Worker secrets for `bun run dev`, copied from .dev.vars.template.
.dev.vars
# Account, custom domain and access key for a local `bun run deploy`, copied from .env.local.template.
.env.local
